</div> <div n="2"> <head> <hi rendition="#g">Capitel</hi> <hi rendition="#aq">X</hi>.<lb/>
</head> <milestone unit="section" rendition="#hr"/> <p>Fu&#x0364;r die Ge&#x017F;chichte von Tyrol &#x017F;ind die Werke<lb/>
