</div> <div n="2"> <head> <hi rendition="#g">Capitel</hi> <hi rendition="#aq">IX</hi>.<lb/>
</head> <milestone unit="section" rendition="#hr"/> <p>Die Tyroler &#x017F;ind &#x017F;cho&#x0364;n, heiter, ehrlich, brav,<lb/>
